# PTCS 0.2.40 Dynamic dependency cascade

## Background
SPA Host exact dependency graph仍鎖PTCS 0.2.39，無法直接消費View As unread修正版本。

## Goal
Align active PTCS.Dynamic packages with exact PulseTrade.Comm.Spa 0.2.40 after the View As unread race fix.

## Assumption
This is a binary dependency alignment only; renderer, DSL, schema and TA behavior remain unchanged.

## Planned steps
Update exact references and package versions, build fresh WebSharper packages, push NuGet artifacts, and verify SPA Host restore/build.

## Scope
Dynamic, Dynamic.Ptcs and Dynamic.Ptcs.Client package references/versions only; no feature behavior changes.

## Acceptance
Release builds and package pushes succeed; downstream Host restores without NU1608 for these packages.

## Risk
Pre-existing ACL-locked generated `websharper.log` files may block canonical output cleanup; any isolated build must use the same tracked source and regenerate bundles.

